menu-item-3447\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D3420.html\">후원 방법</a></li>\n\t<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-3117\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D603.html\">협력상담사</a></li>\n\t<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-4499\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D4496.html\">협력단체</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-3112\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D2872.html\">자주 묻는 질문</a></li>\n<li class=\"lang-item lang-item-72 lang-item-en no-translation lang-item-first menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-5635-en\"><a href=\"#/page?file=en%2Findex.html\" hreflang=\"en-CA\" lang=\"en-CA\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"English\" width=\"16\" height=\"11\" style=\"width: 16px; height: 11px;\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></li>\n</ul>\t\t\t\t</nav>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>  </header>\n<!-- = Page banner area start = \\-->\n<section class=\"grop-banner-area grop-page_banner_height-200 \" style=\"background-image: url(&quot;./archive/wp-content/uploads/2020/03/4_banner_event.jpg&quot;); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: center center; background-size: cover; background-attachment: ;\">\n\t<div class=\"overlay\" style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"grop-full_height  container\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"grop-vertical_middle  text-uppercase  grop-page_title\">행사 | Events</h2>\n\t</div>\n\t<!--banner overly start\\-->\n\t<div class=\"grop-page_banr_overly_opc-30\"></div><!--/banner overly end-->\n</section>\n<section id=\"tribe-events-pg-template\" class=\"tribe-events-pg-template\" role=\"main\"><div class=\"tribe-events-before-html\"></div><span class=\"tribe-events-ajax-loading\"><img class=\"tribe-events-spinner-medium\" src=\"./archive/wp-content/plugins/the-events-calendar/src/resources/images/tribe-loading.gif\" alt=\"일정표 불러오는 중\" loading=\"lazy\"></span>\n<div id=\"tribe-events-content\" class=\"tribe-events-single\">\n\n\t<p class=\"tribe-events-back\">\n\t\t<a href=\"#/page?file=events-list%2Findex.html\"> « 전체 이벤트</a>\n\t</p>\n\n\t<!-- Notices -->\n\t\n\t<h1 class=\"tribe-events-single-event-title\">온라인 “부부 데이트” | On-line workshop for Married couple</h1>\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-schedule tribe-clearfix\">\n\t\t<h2><span class=\"tribe-event-date-start\">2020-10-17@10:00 오전</span>-<span class=\"tribe-event-date-end\">2020-11-07@12:30 오후</span></h2>\t</div>\n\n\t<!-- Event header -->\n\t<div id=\"tribe-events-header\" data-title=\"온라인 “부부 데이트” - 러브 토론토 (Love Toronto)\" data-viewtitle=\"온라인 “부부 데이트”\">\n\t\t<!-- Navigation -->\n\t\t<nav class=\"tribe-events-nav-pagination\" aria-label=\"이벤트 네비게이션\">\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"tribe-events-sub-nav\">\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"tribe-events-nav-previous\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D3875.html\"><span>«</span> 이전</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"tribe-events-nav-next\"><a href=\"#/page?file=index__p%3D4311.html\">다음 <span>»</span></a></li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t<!-- .tribe-events-sub-nav -->\n\t\t</nav>\n\t</div>\n\t<!-- #tribe-events-header -->\n\n\t\t\t<div id=\"post-3857\" class=\"post-3857 tribe_events type-tribe_events status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry\">\n\t\t\t<!-- Event featured image, but exclude link -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-event-image\"><img width=\"1152\" height=\"1728\" src=\"./archive/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/%EB%B6%80%EB%B6%80%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B82020.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1152px) 100vw, 1152px\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n\t\t\t<!-- Event content -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-event-description tribe-events-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>COVID 19 팬데믹이 지속되면서 가족이 함께 집에 지내는 시간이 늘어난 것 같습니다.<br>\n가족간의 좋은 관계를 형성하는 좋은 기회이기도 하지만, 반면에 그동안 내재되었던 가족간 갈등이 노출되기도 합니다. 특히 부부간에 갈등이 노출되었을때 더 친밀하고 행복한 관계로 나아갈 수 있는 좋은 기회이기도 합니다.<br>\nLove Family 에서는 작년에 시행해서 좋은 결과를 얻었던 오프라인 ‘부부 데이트’ 프로그램을 올해엔 Zoom 툴을 이용한 온라인 부부 데이트 프로그램을 준비하였습니다.<br>\n오는 10월 17일부터 매주 토요일 4주간 진행됩니다.<br>\n온라인 특성상 시/공간의 제약을 적게 받는 장점을 살려, 강사분들이 한국(한국 부부학교 강사/ 4일차)/미국(미주 부부학교 강사/1일차)/캐나다(Love Family 강사/2,3일차)에서 강의를 진행하게 됩니다. 지원자들도 여러 지역에서 많이 참여하기를 기대합니다.<br>\n프로그램 내용(첨부 포스터 참조)은 전문 강사들의 강의와 소그룹 나눔, 부부간 엑티비티 등으로 구성되어 있습니다.’</p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"./archive/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/%EB%B6%80%EB%B6%80%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B8%EC%8B%A0%EC%B2%AD%EC%84%9C.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-document=\"pdf\">[다운로드] 부부데이트신청서&nbsp;</a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<!-- .tribe-events-single-event-description -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events tribe-common\">\n\t<div class=\"tribe-events-c-subscribe-dropdown__container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-c-subscribe-dropdown\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-common-c-btn-border tribe-events-c-subscribe-dropdown__button\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg class=\"tribe-common-c-svgicon tribe-common-c-svgicon--cal-export tribe-events-c-subscribe-dropdown__export-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 23 17\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n\t<path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M.128.896V16.13c0 .211.145.383.323.383h15.354c.179 0 .323-.172.323-.383V.896c0-.212-.144-.383-.323-.383H.451C.273.513.128.684.128.896Zm16 6.742h-.901V4.679H1.009v10.729h14.218v-3.336h.901V7.638ZM1.01 1.614h14.218v2.058H1.009V1.614Z\"></path>\n\t<path d=\"M20.5 9.846H8.312M18.524 6.953l2.89 2.909-2.855 2.855\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</svg>\n\t\t\t\t<button class=\"tribe-events-c-subscribe-dropdown__button-text\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"tribe-events-subscribe-dropdown-content\" aria-label=\"캘린더에 이벤트를 추가하기 위한 링크 보기\">\n\t\t\t\t\t캘린더에 추가하기\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t<svg class=\"tribe-common-c-svgicon tribe-common-c-svgicon--caret-down tribe-events-c-subscribe-dropdown__button-icon\